# Build context for the DEMO image only (see docs/DEMO-HOSTING.md). The product is a
# Tauri binary; none of the desktop toolchain belongs in a web container.
#
# ⚠️ `private/` is the important line. It is gitignored, so CI never sees it — but a
# LOCAL `docker build` copies the working tree, and that directory holds the Steam
# endpoint catalogs, the lab notes and a saved reference page containing other
# people's Steam profiles. Multi-stage means it would not reach the final image, but
# it would sit in a build layer, and that is close enough to be worth refusing.
private/
CLAUDE.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.idea

# Reinstalled inside the image; copying the host's tree is slow and can be the wrong
# platform's binaries.
node_modules
dist
.vite

# Desktop-only. src-tauri/target is measured in gigabytes.
src-tauri

# Reference material the build does not read — `design/` is cited in comments only.
design
docs
scripts

*.log
.DS_Store
